{"sections":[{"slug":"投射对象","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"投射对象"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">投射对象</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"投射对象"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">在一个范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">称对象</span> $P$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">投射对象</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是指</span> $\\operatorname{Hom}(P,-)\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathsf{Set}$ <span lang=\"zh\">保持</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/满射(范畴论)","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">满射</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">也即</span> $P$ <span lang=\"zh\">具有关于满射的左提升性质</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即对任意满射</span> $A\\twoheadrightarrow B$, <span lang=\"zh\">态射</span> $P\\to B$ <span lang=\"zh\">可提升为</span> $P\\to A$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">在</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Abel范畴","text":"Abel <span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">对象</span> $P$ <span lang=\"zh\">为投射对象当且仅当</span> $\\operatorname{Hom}(P,-)$ <span lang=\"zh\">正合</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">称范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$ <strong><span lang=\"zh\">有足够多投射对象</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是指每个对象都有来自投射对象的满射</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/选择公理","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">选择公理</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的一种表述是集合范畴的每个对象都是投射对象</span>.</p>\n<p>$\\mathsf{Ab}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的投射对象为自由群</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于交换环</span> $R$, $R\\mathsf{Mod}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的投射对象为自由模的直和项</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/紧投射生成元","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">紧投射生成元</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}